on external voice applications. Lobby Management We also improved lobby management. The lobby host can now remove players from the session when necessary. This gives hosts more control over their multiplayer sessions. Minor fixes We also fixed several ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T10:01:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353653","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4295140-1837955055357995","game_id":"steam-4295140","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update, Multiplayer Fix & Valve Mechanic Improvement","summary":"Multiplayer Progression Fix & Valve Mechanic Update Hi everyone, we have released a new update for the Liminal Backrooms demo. Multiplayer progression fix We fixed an issue that prevented the upper-floor levers from becoming interactable after completing the valve objective in some multiplayer sessions. The progression now works correctly for the whole team. Valve mechanic improvement We also improved the valve mechanic. All players must now be present before the valve sequence can begin. This c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T20:46:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055357995","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4295140-1836506165584521","game_id":"steam-4295140","kind":"announcement","title":"Navigation Improvements, Shy Guy Audio Changes and Minor Fixes","summary":"New Demo Update Available Hi everyone, we have released another small update for the Liminal Backrooms demo. This update focuses on improving navigation during the final part of the offshore platform tutorial, balancing the Shy Guy's audio presence and fixing several minor issues. Improved Navigation to the Captain's Cabin We have added new environmental guidance to make the path back to the Captain's Cabin easier to understand. The update includes: Two new light posts placed along the return pa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T20:39:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165584521","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4295140-1836506165578926","game_id":"steam-4295140","kind":"announcement","title":"New Objective Tracker Added to the Demo","summary":"New Objective Tracker Added to the Demo Hi everyone, we have released a new small update for the Liminal Backrooms demo. After watching players explore the offshore platform and reading your feedback, we noticed that some objectives were clear, but finding their location could sometimes take too long. To improve the pacing of the introductory level, we have added a new Objective Tracker. How does it work? For selected objectives, you can now press Q to display the distance to the current target.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T20:53:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578926","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4295140-1836506165574629","game_id":"steam-4295140","kind":"announcement","title":"Achievements, DirectX 11 Support and Minor Fixes","summary":"New Demo Update Available Hi everyone, we have released a new update for the Liminal Backrooms demo. This update introduces Steam achievements, adds DirectX 11 compatibility and includes several minor bug fixes and improvements. Steam Achievements Steam achievements are now available in the demo. Some will unlock naturally as you progress, while others may require you to explore carefully, survive certain encounters or pay attention to what is happening around you. Can you unlock them all? Direc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-05T20:35:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165574629","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4295140-1836506165555420","game_id":"steam-4295140","kind":"announcement","title":"Piccolo aggiornamento demo, Lingua spagnola, sistema di allarme e fix minori","summary":"Small Demo Update Available NowHi everyone,we have released a small new update for the Liminal Backrooms demo.This update focuses on additional language support, clearer in-game feedback and minor fixes based on the latest playtests and player feedback.What changedSpanish language support addedAlarm system added\\ to improve tension and feedback during specific momentsMinor bug fixes across the demoSmall gameplay and stability improvementsSpanish language supportThe demo now also supports Spanish","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T23:05:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165555420","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4295140-1836506165551856","game_id":"steam-4295140","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Available - Now platform Improvements and New Languages","summary":"Demo Update Available NowHi everyone,we have released a new update for the Liminal Backrooms demo.First of all, thank you to everyone who has played the demo, shared feedback, posted videos, reported issues or simply added the demo to their Steam library.Your feedback has already helped us understand what needed to be improved, especially in the introductory offshore platform section.What changed in this updateImproved platform lightingWe increased the lighting and readability on the offshore pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T21:10:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165551856","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4295140-1836506165546880","game_id":"steam-4295140","kind":"announcement","title":"Liminal Backrooms Demo is now available, we need your feedback","summary":"The Liminal Backrooms demo is now available on SteamHi everyone,the demo for Liminal Backrooms is now available to play on Steam.This is our first public demo, and your feedback is extremely important for us. We want to understand what works, what feels unclear, and what should be improved before the full release.What is included in the demo?The demo begins on an abandoned offshore platformwhich works as the introductory section of the game.This first area is designed to let players learn the ba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T18:46:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165546880","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4295140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4295140":"2026-10-26T12:06:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4295140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:06Z"},"4854290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_full